# Laser Spin, Area Bomb, Rocket Punch, Heal Beam, attacks, a Revive, Full Tonics, Elixirs, HyperEthers and MegaElixirs.
# Ending: the staff credits with the three sleeping monsters and the "The End zz" screen.
